 | JSON Schema | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
 | Regex | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
 | Grammar | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ |
+
+### Validating XGrammar sources
+
+`XGrammarBackend` accepts a default `validate_grammar` callback. Each processor
+factory inherits it when the argument is omitted, can replace it for one
+request, or can disable validation with explicit `None`. The selected callback
+receives the original source before compilation. Any normal return value is
+accepted; a raised exception is propagated without compiling and does not make
+later requests unusable.
